        "TileImage": "$($repository 7af86858-df9d-478b-b5d8-803379cd165f).Image",
        "Description": "Richard&apos;s wife, Susan, discovered that he was having an affair with the late Frank Schmidt. Upon this discovery, she started planning of how best to dispose of her unfaithful husband. Schmidt had often played the role of grill master at their house, which now left a bitter taste in Susan&apos;s mouth. \r\rShe wants this elimination to come with the message of knowledge, and with a personal touch. We think that the added bonus of using Schmidt&apos;s weapon would be a fitting cherry on top.",
